<v Lina   Misitzis>If Alex didn't want to talk about Cats anymore, EJ wanted to be a good partner. So she went somewhere else. She announced the new plan in a tweet. Quote, "My husband couldn't listen to me talking about it anymore, so I'm doing a podcast about the movie musical Cats. It's called PodCats."
<v Lina   Misitzis>如果亚历克斯不想再谈论《猫》了，EJ想做一个好伴侣。所以她去了别的地方。她在一条推文中宣布了新计划。引述：“我丈夫不能再听我谈论它了，所以我正在做一个关于音乐剧电影《猫》的播客。它叫PodCats。”

00:50:45.800 --> 00:50:48.730
<v Ej Dickson>Are you blind when you're born?
