<v Lina Misitzis>In front of us are four teenagers slouched in their seats. They're laughing throughout the previews, which makes me think they're probably stoned. EJ notices them, too.
<v Lina Misitzis>在我们前面是四个瘫坐在座位上的青少年。他们在预告片期间一直笑，这让我觉得他们可能嗑了药。EJ也注意到了他们。

