<v Lina  Misitzis>The film opens with a burlap sack tossed in an alleyway, which, obviously, is full of alley cats. Dozens of them circle the disposed sack, hissing, also doing pirouettes. And just to be clear, by cats, I mean human adults with fur digitally attached to their skin. One of them rips open the still-moving bag, allowing whatever is inside of it to break free. And what it is inside of this bag-- also a cat.
<v Lina  Misitzis>电影开场是一个被扔进小巷里的麻布袋，显然，里面装满了流浪猫。几十只猫围着被丢弃的袋子，嘶叫着，还在做旋转动作。为了说清楚，猫指的就是身上数字化贴着皮毛的人类成年人。其中一只猫撕开了还在动的袋子，让里面的东西挣脱出来。而袋子里装的那个东西——也是一只猫。

