<v Man>Stop, and you're talking around your bowl on an empty stomach.
<v Man>停下，你正空着肚子在你的碗周围说话。

00:53:33.030 --> 00:54:03.560
<v Lina Misitzis>Look, I'm not going to pretend Cats isn't a train wreck. Alex covers his mouth with his hand, like he's hiding his abject horror. But then, about 15 minutes into the movie, when Rebel Wilson starts singing and dancing with a parade of cockroaches, I realized something. EJ and Alex are on a really good date. For most of the movie, they hold hands. Alex kisses EJ's palm three times, which coincides with the number of times she calls something the best part of the movie.
<v Lina Misitzis>听着，我不会假装《猫》不是一场火车失事。亚历克斯用手捂住嘴，好像在隐藏他绝望的恐惧。但在电影开始大约15分钟后，当瑞贝尔·威尔森开始对着一群蟑螂唱歌跳舞时，我意识到了一些事情。EJ和亚历克斯正在进行一次非常好的约会。电影的大部分时间里，他们都牵着手。亚历克斯吻了EJ的手心三次，这和她三次称某事是“电影中最棒的部分”的次数不谋而合。

00:54:03.560 --> 00:54:08.550
<v Ej Dickson>This is the best part. [INAUDIBLE]. This is the best part.
<v Ej Dickson>这是最棒的部分。（听不清）这是最棒的部分。

00:54:08.550 --> 00:54:33.720
<v Lina Misitzis>I think what makes this a good date has nothing to do with what they're doing, but, instead, with the fact that they're doing it together. When Judi Dench's Old Deuteronomy shows up, who, by the way, is, for some reason, wearing a fur coat atop her literal coat of fur, Alex hums along with the rest of the cats, who are there to welcome her, because, of course, he knows the music. It's been playing in his house nonstop for months.
<v Lina Misitzis>我觉得让这次约会成功的原因与他们正在做的事情无关，而是因为他们正一起做这件事。当朱迪·丹奇饰演的老戒律猫出现时，顺便说一句，因为某种原因，她在自己毛皮大衣外面又穿了一件皮毛大衣，亚历克斯随着其他欢迎她的猫一起哼唱，因为，当然，他知道这段音乐。它已经在他家里连续几个月不停地播放了。

