<v Lina Misitzis>So something you told me before we went in is that part of you really does think that EJ's kind of just being a contrarian in liking this movie. And I'm wondering if you still feel that way?
<v Lina Misitzis>所以你在我们进去之前告诉我的一件事是，你内心一部分确实认为EJ只是因为唱反调才喜欢这部电影。我想知道你现在是否还是那种感觉？

